  "title": "What Buyers Actually Say to an AI Sales Agent at 2:14pm on a Sunday",
  "summary": "The most useful thing about an AI Sales Agent isn't what it does - it's what it surfaces. This piece walks through two real, anonymized AI Sales Agent conversations from powersports dealerships - one a 15-minute Sunday-afternoon trade-in conversation that ended in a Tuesday showroom appointment, one a 9:37am inventory check that turned into a same-day phone call in three minutes - and pulls out what the back-and-forth reveals about how buyers actually want to be sold to.",
